WEBVTT

00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:09,270
Hi, this is Eric, and I'm Joni Hansen, and this is our daughter, Stephanie Hansen.

00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:14,110
And when she was 12 years old, she was diagnosed with an incurable cancer that the medical

00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,710
world didn't have a protocol for.

00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:21,430
So this is a Stephanie, and she'll kind of give you a little, how this kind of journey

00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,430
started.

00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:28,430
Hi, so at age 12, I went to the hospital thinking I had appendicitis, but soon realized

00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:33,990
that after many scans that I had cancer, it was crazy to think that I could ever get cancer.

00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:39,110
But with the help of my parents and doctors and nurses, they helped me to get where I

00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:42,270
am today, a survivor.

00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,270
She's amazing.

00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:49,470
It hasn't been a fun journey or easy journey, but it is a journey that you definitely can do

00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:55,350
and succeed if you are, well, we all love the Lord.

00:00:55,350 --> 00:01:05,230
We trust 100% on God's direction and His guidance, so we prayed and prayed, and when

00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:10,510
she was diagnosed at the hospital, the doctor came in and said, yep, there's a tumor on

00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:13,550
her bladder, and yes, that means cancer.

00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:20,030
So that stopped us in our tracks, lots of tears right away, and after we, but in that nanosecond

00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:25,510
of time, that only God did, He said, resist the spirit of fear.

00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:30,950
And He showed me what fear does is it grips your heart, and it renders you paralyzed and

00:01:30,950 --> 00:01:31,950
ineffective.

00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:36,750
And there is no way that I was going to be ineffective for my baby.

00:01:36,750 --> 00:01:46,430
And also He showed me at that same time that what fear does, it causes confusion and anger,

00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:54,100
bitterness, confusion, and division was the last one, and it was the division that hit

00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:57,280
me to the heart.

00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:01,520
And then after we hugged and we prayed, it's definitely locked out in the hallway.

00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:05,760
And Eric came out, and the first thing out of his mouth was, we are going to fight this

00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:09,440
as a united front, we are not going to be divided.

00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:15,080
And so just knowing that we had that assurance right away, right as the diagnosis was put

00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:18,920
out there, we knew we were going to be okay.

00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:23,120
No matter how it ended up, we knew the Lord was in control.

00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:29,920
And at that point, I continued to say, you know, people would say, aren't you mad at God?

00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,920
Different things like that?

00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,920
And don't you wonder why?

00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:38,080
And I'd say, I can't ask why, because God is sovereign and I am not.

00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:43,680
And no reason is good enough for this mama to have this happen to her baby.

00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:50,480
So and Eric said, right from the time of diagnosis, I am expecting God to show us glory through

00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:57,580
this, no matter how, what the end result is, because we didn't know.

00:02:57,580 --> 00:03:04,860
So with that, we ended up in oncology, and we had a double hickman installed, found out

00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:05,860
it.

00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:12,180
She had a tumor removed for her bladder, and it was the first operation and only operation

00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:14,940
she had, which was really good.

00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:23,460
And we did not, the medical world had no cure for her.

00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:29,180
So that's when we began our journey to find out what we should do, and we pursued a lot

00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:33,700
of different avenues, and a lot of people had a lot of advice for us, and we put them

00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:42,540
in basically a box until we had as much information as we could, and then we prayed about it, and

00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:49,260
we were led to Dr. Connor's clinic, and the protocol that he had, and it was VIA, one

00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:56,980
of our friends whose daughter, he was able to help here, and so we already had a contact

00:03:56,980 --> 00:04:05,500
that there was a success with cancer, and so we were very excited and optimistic.

00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:10,660
So when we came for our first consultation, it was just Eric and I, after he had examined

00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:15,780
to Stephanie, and she went out in the lobby, and so Eric and I are just, this is really

00:04:15,780 --> 00:04:16,780
cool.

00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:18,460
Yeah, this is really cool.

00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:23,000
So Eric and I are sitting there, and then, so he knows the history what's going on, and

00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:28,400
he didn't know what we had been telling people or anything, and then he shares about himself

00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:35,700
and he was talking about, he said, I am not the healer, God is the healer, and it's hard

00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:39,720
when people come in, so you need to heal me, you need to heal me, he goes, God is sovereign,

00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:45,920
I am not, and I almost fall off my chair, because he didn't know that that's what I was saying,

00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:50,400
and then he continued to say, and it's God that gets the glory through this, no matter

00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:55,640
how what the outcome is, if you allow them, and that was exactly what Eric had been saying.

00:04:55,640 --> 00:05:00,920
So when we walked out, we were like, we know this is where the Lord is directing us for

00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:09,600
this protocol, and so we jumped in, full guns, and didn't worry much about what we were

00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:15,160
going to look like as far as financial, because when you are praying, and you're connected,

00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:22,440
and not divided, you got to just really trust that the Lord will provide, because it's not

00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:29,080
a want, it's a need, and at that point, that's what God promises, I will provide for your

00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:34,320
needs, and we needed something for our little girl, and so that's what brought us here, and

00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:41,840
that's what helped us sign on the dotted line, so to say, but it's just great because

00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:47,560
the other forms of protocol, that they were trying, the medical world was trying to give

00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:54,520
us, or would give her two other forms of cancer, that was a side effect, and that's like, not

00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,520
okay.

00:05:55,520 --> 00:06:05,850
Yeah, not okay, so, anyway, so she's strong and healthy, she's now 17, and just

00:06:05,850 --> 00:06:09,210
doing really well, so that's wonderful.

00:06:09,210 --> 00:06:11,210
Yeah, so any other specific questions?

00:06:11,210 --> 00:06:14,930
You know, thanks so much, you guys did such a great job, thank you so much for sharing,

00:06:14,930 --> 00:06:22,930
we really appreciate it, but we really appreciate the staff here and Dr. Conner's, and that there's

00:06:22,930 --> 00:06:32,730
hope for those that aren't given hope, and go on, one other thing, is like with natural paths

00:06:32,730 --> 00:06:40,690
and this natural way, it's hard sometimes, because people don't understand it, and it's

00:06:40,690 --> 00:06:48,210
against the grain, but one of the things that I tell people is, as far as side effects and

00:06:48,210 --> 00:06:54,170
negative side effects, really the only negative side effect is that it wouldn't help, it's not

00:06:54,170 --> 00:07:01,490
going to cause something else, or destroy her body via chemicals and things like that,

00:07:01,490 --> 00:07:06,730
the only thing that it's going to do is just not affect it, then there's other things

00:07:06,730 --> 00:07:14,330
that you can do, so with like medical bills ramping up, you know, it's, you really need to

00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:18,610
weigh the pills and the cons, you're going to be spending anyway, but what are you doing

00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:21,090
to your body in the meantime?

00:07:21,090 --> 00:07:26,970
So the natural way is the way that we would go, even if something new came up with my health

00:07:26,970 --> 00:07:33,570
or aerosol, or any other other kids, is that would be the choice we would invest our

00:07:33,570 --> 00:07:42,730
resources in what's natural, because it's not going to hurt us in a long picture, so we

00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:46,810
think it's the way to go, yeah, very good, thank you so much.

